                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7549a39-df47-31a2-a9e0-99bbe4a273f3",
                        "entry_id": "fdb3f4d7-3c36-3e97-b526-95e0cbce10c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To undervalue; to underestimate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "adf0a046-bd0f-49de-b5c8-dd251f3b6681",
                                "sense_id": "f7549a39-df47-31a2-a9e0-99bbe4a273f3",
                                "text": "[…] Yet look, how far / The substance of my praise doth wrong this shadow / In underprizing it, so far this shadow / Doth limp behind the substance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47a5cff6-b255-4a5b-af17-ba281e1df4a5",
                                "sense_id": "f7549a39-df47-31a2-a9e0-99bbe4a273f3",
                                "text": "[…] euery man ouer-ualuing his owne worth, would be a Commander: euery man vnder prizing anothers value, denied to be commanded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "771d02fa-fe0d-43b3-ad74-9b20f41c0e1e",
                                "sense_id": "f7549a39-df47-31a2-a9e0-99bbe4a273f3",
                                "text": "Teach me to underprize this life, and I / Shall finde my loſſe the eaſier, vvhen I dye; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eaaf3502-7684-4b39-9098-171048d1f862",
                                "sense_id": "f7549a39-df47-31a2-a9e0-99bbe4a273f3",
                                "text": "No: it would never do to underprize this proof of good will or to read in Liane’s warning any spirit but one of the most earnest anxiety."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90c27c5c-ca45-47eb-a242-11630154d309",
                                "sense_id": "f7549a39-df47-31a2-a9e0-99bbe4a273f3",
                                "text": "I underprized your far-out, blathering genius."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
